#: scenario:scenario_A3832915_2CD3_4509_9CB5_A5D2CEB1D45C
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: ce7a8b2861f612a6183942daf265d00bd5505adce07d2164ca2db985b8db4e44
#. default-sha256: 23826eb11fed1bb340ee848100f5770a1ae507ffc67361479604c7f8c285af5d
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_A3832915_2CD3_4509_9CB5_A5D2CEB1D45C"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫—nothing. ⟪k:1⟫He could not speak."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫他想要发出声音，⟪k:1⟫但话语呛在了喉咙里。⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫这白色长发，⟪k:4⟫这身剪影，⟪k:5⟫应该是"
"「她」才对。"

#: scenario:scenario_F3238D63_F0DF_4916_94E5_10AA2F5002F0
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: c611d5c19173f69a4c0c5bffe38cb642c2ab9d713b4e679b238c34a60861c856
#. default-sha256: 6ada79b8763b9e79cbeeaedb0c6971343dbed5090767bf4af9a7900de47a48a7
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_F3238D63_F0DF_4916_94E5_10AA2F5002F0"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫The silhouette hanging above him was certainly the White-Haired Girl’s. ⟪k:1⟫Or was it? ⟪k:2⟫"
"Because his next words were—"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫……但是，⟪k:1⟫真的是「她」吗？⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫……因为……⟪k:4⟫刚才的语调——"

#: scenario:scenario_71606EEB_9DAB_4875_B9AD_52E5AFA70C4E
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: f16eb6b09b2e054beac0f4744a0ca576b3881a075560e43f151005f57c76fdc9
#. default-sha256: d369467ba8ae878ca542664cbdd4bf1aaa91ddb353e543ad40006432ac084e44
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_71606EEB_9DAB_4875_B9AD_52E5AFA70C4E"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫G-⟪k:1⟫Get off me!"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫放、⟪k:1⟫放开我——！！"

#: scenario:scenario_F3473CBE_D848_48B2_B063_CD14C0C95CF2
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 08c08d4b5550564b0221539c1d80ec208ea75376a5ed0825d654fa6f70128128
#. default-sha256: 0ebf54024f7850c8860f27fffa21713b6a1a96c67b28696714981dd0ce073dff
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_F3473CBE_D848_48B2_B063_CD14C0C95CF2"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫He reflexively shoved the girl straddling him aside."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫一瞬间的犹豫后，⟪k:3⟫他把倚靠在身上的白发少女用力推开。"

#: scenario:scenario_1A37FEE3_0439_4DDF_B367_E6B25F979DAF
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 756831622956d53535cf3d4f214b9ba5553343afe8fb3c6584b582118f5fe390
#. default-sha256: eb12de5bf19fea716a60b94482d93c320c66426486328331b7a73ce7861f63ba
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_1A37FEE3_0439_4DDF_B367_E6B25F979DAF"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫She rolled off the bed, landing on the cold floor, ⟪k:1⟫but slowly, gradually, she crawled "
"her way back toward him."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫她从床上摔落，⟪k:1⟫撞在冰冷的地面上。⟪k:2⟫但是，她只是一言不发地挺起身，⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫慢慢地，"
"⟪k:5⟫慢慢地，⟪k:6⟫向着梅尔爬去。"

#: scenario:scenario_19CA1D14_E2F2_4A56_B339_D8285223D006
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: e6424d5661ad2d2bd960dac4e2f7eccd18cd5adc757e943d064828235cadbc09
#. default-sha256: 769a849c4880c70c73f666d39d1b796670b53391ac6be30f60349d2d681b2a6c
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_19CA1D14_E2F2_4A56_B339_D8285223D006"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫That wasn’t very nice..."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫真是过分啊……"

#: scenario:scenario_2B55BD27_3FD5_4A63_86AC_84FA9D2F569C
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: c091e8ead556cca281a65e7d8f442c6c835e1c644436b0733d88a66fccbedb41
#. default-sha256: b2f343bf8bef21e88a5f49d9107ce688ed210060f64b8308203437f423fd7007
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_2B55BD27_3FD5_4A63_86AC_84FA9D2F569C"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Veiled in darkness, she slowly lifted her head. ⟪k:1⟫And then—⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫there was another "
"flash of lightning.⟪k:4⟫"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫在黑暗中，⟪k:1⟫她缓缓地抬起了头。⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫同时——⟪k:4⟫外面再一次，响起雷鸣。⟪k:5⟫"

#: scenario:scenario_AE6F7AD3_974C_4BEE_881E_691681260D1C
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 4444b65fffd069ef06436d826e7d2e55d3a82e26a4b28618e8b3b04256d1a5a9
#. default-sha256: 737128173c421fd1272d098a75f2543954e1bd2e8a4b62f6d82a738c376307e8
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_AE6F7AD3_974C_4BEE_881E_691681260D1C"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫The heavy fabric of the curtains rustled, bolts of light streaming between the gaps."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫如弓箭般的一道电光，⟪k:1⟫穿透了厚重窗帘的幕布，⟪k:2⟫映射在卧室的墙壁上……"

#: scenario:scenario_E0BE2D06_DD56_40C9_863A_9A4AAF6A3D39
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 43e1d98648a4c58332092bbe9042bdcd9f7caa18a4ea94d9337a00e9fba08289
#. default-sha256: 35d9c5db3ed947ba9e593a713953d3c88295b1835521f24eb0ea774a61836a56
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_E0BE2D06_DD56_40C9_863A_9A4AAF6A3D39"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫⟪k:11⟫⟪k:12⟫⟪k:13⟫⟪k:14⟫⟪k:15⟫⟪k:16⟫⟪k:17⟫"
"⟪k:18⟫⟪k:19⟫⟪k:20⟫Her flaxen irises glimmered. ⟪k:21⟫Though in the bluish-white light, they took "
"on a twinge of almost golden glow."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫⟪k:11⟫⟪k:12⟫⟪k:13⟫⟪k:14⟫⟪k:15⟫⟪k:16⟫⟪k:17⟫"
"⟪k:18⟫⟪k:19⟫⟪k:20⟫……同时，⟪k:21⟫映照出「她」的亚麻色瞳孔。⟪k:22⟫不，⟪k:23⟫反射着雷电光芒的双眸，"
"⟪k:24⟫此刻已不再是亚麻色，⟪k:25⟫而是宛如黄金一般，⟪k:26⟫正闪闪发亮。"

#: scenario:scenario_96413F74_9E88_415D_9DEB_7741E6D711E4
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: dd51cebb046a16b52bd9cd924eb6a98c33d863961a85b89bfc0d604a3293b9fe
#. default-sha256: 877615bca39a8ad92926fcfb36b1fbb21f23678db16d44ee4f30be52eeccf7ba
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_96413F74_9E88_415D_9DEB_7741E6D711E4"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫No need to be so rough.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫This isn’t the first time she’s visited your bedchamber,"
"⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫is it, Mell?"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫我不是已经来过你的卧室很多次了吗？⟪k:1⟫不用这么无情吧。⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫对吧？⟪k:4⟫梅尔？"

#: scenario:scenario_F689B45C_AAEA_445E_B158_18D9E7B52AA2
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 6e8c09adb2aec02cf4842c46c7bdee38d12113927a0e1aa32353e17dd59cb82e
#. default-sha256: 58f1665df75fd1d1808c4952d9b01746e95ba1f532b73c06221125622492175a
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_F689B45C_AAEA_445E_B158_18D9E7B52AA2"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Or did I not kiss you the same way?⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Tell me, how does she run her fingers across "
"your skin?⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫What does she do when she nuzzles up to you?"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫还是说……⟪k:1⟫接吻的方式错了吗？⟪k:2⟫请教教我，⟪k:3⟫「她」是怎样触碰你的，⟪k:4⟫又是怎样依靠你"
"的……"

#: scenario:scenario_706E20D7_6B3F_44A1_A31B_28781913B2C8
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: c7bebd2fd0b0022ad8e56f8bac07bedde8140511e490a59e9a50193e61452bf2
#. default-sha256: 335b71d1770ab4d128495ed4abd87fde95e0dfb715d90660e3a227d6f52755d8
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_706E20D7_6B3F_44A1_A31B_28781913B2C8"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫S— ⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Stop— ⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫Stop this madness, ⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫Nellie!⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫Wh-"
"⟪k:11⟫Why would you... ⟪k:12⟫Why would you do this?!"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫怎……⟪k:1⟫怎么可能⟪k:2⟫——你究竟在做什么？⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫奈莉！！⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫你、⟪k:9⟫你为什"
"么要……⟪k:10⟫要做这种事……"

#: scenario:scenario_0F60EA05_B15B_455C_9597_EE4D757E9178
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 39a401b303b8d698e06e7aa9ec70664b621d621db9a938d4744413fe73feae56
#. default-sha256: 9d51ef21eb94a16f0f14b6667bdd801779bc836d466cdf4e5514c31dd86520e1
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_0F60EA05_B15B_455C_9597_EE4D757E9178"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Because you like white hair, don’t you, Mell?⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫You like white hair, which is why you "
"fell for her, isn’t it?"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫因为……梅尔喜欢白色的头发，⟪k:1⟫对吧？⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫因为喜欢白色的头发，⟪k:4⟫所以才喜欢那个孩子"
"的，⟪k:5⟫对吗？"

#: scenario:scenario_6584834B_2B27_4C60_BECD_C69EC8D9FC5F
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 4a319fd3ca3f7506e7badb603155ce4ebfe687bc1de71118b9496e1e5fc5fb99
#. default-sha256: 7e38022bd618c6a87e25f41170cee1793cb881c94a7a84aaa1b09740c6993c20
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_6584834B_2B27_4C60_BECD_C69EC8D9FC5F"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Ahaha... ⟪k:1⟫So if I have white hair, then you’ll fall for me too.⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫Then I can be "
"your princess again, dearest Mell."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫哈哈……⟪k:1⟫有了白色的长发的话，⟪k:2⟫奈莉也和她一样了哦。⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫又可以成为哥哥大人的公主殿"
"下了。"

#: scenario:scenario_0581AAED_B219_4E76_9F4C_F759584F14B8
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: cb5a8241a414de48696ede7609ef233b89cbdbeec6503938baf754b3a04ba34c
#. default-sha256: a0b3a4d54a49f4f9839b6b63bb8f424d2bb56c76adfed4d761913f99eaa6cfdd
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_0581AAED_B219_4E76_9F4C_F759584F14B8"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫What... ⟪k:1⟫What are you even talking about?"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫什……⟪k:1⟫什么……⟪k:2⟫我根本不明白你在说什么……"

#: scenario:scenario_56C0EA79_04E3_4DF3_9393_D98EF0417E64
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 1cdb5d21625894f4db8d924b6c30f6a7cb14e5b18477d8c674b3cd13eb18bd62
#. default-sha256: b81da31410090d48dd443e7c2e904a296c2b8e6fdc0c40306e507d470478a57c
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_56C0EA79_04E3_4DF3_9393_D98EF0417E64"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫He could not escape from her—⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫from his sister’s piercing gaze. ⟪k:3⟫“Why?” “What "
"happened?” “How could she?”"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫梅尔，⟪k:1⟫完全无法从「她」——⟪k:2⟫奈莉闪着光的金色瞳孔中逃开。⟪k:3⟫「为何？⟪k:4⟫为什么？⟪k:5⟫"
"到底发生了什么？」"

#: scenario:scenario_88E87D89_205B_45F5_854A_3EED23556195
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: fb69510653a5df91d619c71d8f5c213839a5c3728b21b1f283ff472286123493
#. default-sha256: 2f1fd3de93943da6f2f43608f7f6fb4df58592fb5d57e6275a9cd30adb7d3a17
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_88E87D89_205B_45F5_854A_3EED23556195"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Questions crashed into the young man’s mind like waves in a stormy sea."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫——他的脑海里，⟪k:1⟫无数的问题像爆炸一样地出现。"

#: scenario:scenario_7E81027E_A71F_4178_9C1E_AC4E4ACCE1E3
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 602047ab7b1cf75ed4de601da95159d02b25ff94d1a2c7d965e85d886a5df076
#. default-sha256: 896678a065176a987e6d15ef4f653a5992feb379f32e433d8f32743ac73012f9
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_7E81027E_A71F_4178_9C1E_AC4E4ACCE1E3"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫But none of them found answers; they simply caused him further perplexity."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫但，⟪k:1⟫无论哪一个都找不到答案。⟪k:2⟫他只是，如同被冻结了无法动身。"

#: scenario:scenario_B003D897_E99E_4E93_A1AF_0E6168B74274
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
